  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CAPFISH Capture - Post Harvest Fisheries Development</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The objectif of the action is to support the development of post-harvest fisheries, through upgrading of the regulatory and institutional system responsible for the control of the food safety of the fishery products, as well as the adoption of better practices and innovation by the private sector&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
